OL,3,ATrump threatens new tariffs on Canadian
OL,4,Avehicles after trade talks collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth countries were optimistic of a
OL,7,Fdeal, but talks fell apart with each
OL,8,Faccusing the other of making
OL,9,Flast-minute changes
OL,11,F"They asked too much and they offered
OL,12,Ftoo little," Carney said
OL,14,FChief US trade negotiator Jamieson
OL,15,FGreer also accused the Canadian side of
OL,16,Fwanting more
OL,18,FCarney is at an event in Quebec, which
OL,19,Fcan be seen by clicking 'watch live' at
OL,20,Fthe top of this page
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
